# Pages and product

Follow `docs/PAGES.md` for every route, screen contents, and implementation order.

User-facing copy (nav, titles, subtitles) stays everyday language even when `docs/PAGES.md` uses a domain word (KYC, ledger, taxonomy). URLs follow the names people see. Admin slugs: `config/adminRoutes.ts`.

- `(auth)` — no app chrome. `(public)` tourist. `(user)` signed-in user area. `(provider)` ops. `(admin)` command center.
- Unapproved providers stay on onboarding/pending.
- Staff cannot see owner nav: profile, ledger, staff, settings.
- Staff see inventory read-only: they can view rooms and stock, but no add / edit / delete, price, or stock controls. Owners keep full edit.
- Booking is cash-on-arrival. Voucher = QR + 6-char backup code (`reciept-logo.png`).
- Reviews only after check-in. Web check-in is backup code (camera is Flutter).
- Do not skip the order in `docs/PAGES.md` §10 unless the user asks.
